---
// KaTeX's stylesheet, mounted per page instead of imported by `Base.astro`.
//
// It is not small: 28 `@font-face` rules carrying 20 base64 woff2 fonts (about
// 12 KB of CSS before they are even used) plus 230 `.katex*` rules — measured at
// 27.4 % of Base.css, shipped to 223 pages of which 30 contain a formula
// (2026-10-31). Astro emits a component's CSS only into the pages that render
// it, so importing it here keeps the other ~190 pages free of it.
//
// Mounted by `glossary/[slug].astro` when the term body contains a math span.
// A future post or case with a formula must mount it too — `tests/built/katex-
// coverage.test.ts` fails the build's HTML if a page carries `.katex` markup
// without a stylesheet that defines it.
import 'katex/dist/katex.min.css';
---
